 `debug` for debug builds of the engine with `dev_mode`, `dev_build`, and `debug_symbols` disabled\r\n- `dev` for debug builds of the engine with `dev_mode`, `dev_build`, and `debug_symbols` enabled\r\n\r\nThis PR deprecates and removes the `dev` buildtype and instead enables `dev_mode`, `dev_build`, and `debug_symbols` for the `debug` buildtype when building with Android Studio.\r\n\r\nThe `release` buildtype has also been updated such that a `release` build built with Android Studio and signed with non-production keys can be installed side-by-side with a production-signed release (e.g: from the store).\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Update the Android Studio instructions: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/11733\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/miles